WEBVTT

00:19.350 --> 00:20.180
<i>Sir!</i>

00:21.350 --> 00:22.310
<i>Ta-da!</i>

00:23.230 --> 00:24.310
That's a Jellyfish Mushroom.

00:24.980 --> 00:26.940
It'll kill you at first bite.

00:36.030 --> 00:37.700
Time for a break.

00:38.280 --> 00:40.080
Another break?

00:42.660 --> 00:47.960
Sir, we're doing this because of you.
All because of your wasteful spending!

00:55.970 --> 00:56.800
Anyway!

00:57.260 --> 00:59.810
<i>I won't let you come back</i>
<i>until you gather a week's worth of food!</i>

01:00.470 --> 01:02.600
Wonder if I can even gather a day's worth.

01:03.890 --> 01:04.730
All right.

01:38.430 --> 01:39.260
<i>Sir...</i>

01:40.390 --> 01:41.220
<i>Where are we?</i>

01:42.640 --> 01:43.470
Looks like...

01:44.180 --> 01:45.140
it used to be a town.

01:51.060 --> 01:52.860
It's a bit creepy.

01:53.820 --> 01:54.940
<i>It must be haunted!</i>

02:02.200 --> 02:04.410
<i>There's a store! I found a store here!</i>

03:42.180 --> 03:46.560
OLD MAN AND THE COFFEE FIELD

04:03.410 --> 04:04.700
Do you live here alone?

04:11.500 --> 04:13.710
Was this a cafe back in the day?

04:15.790 --> 04:18.250
That's perfect! I'm thirsty.

04:18.840 --> 04:19.960
I'll take a cup of coffee.

04:30.720 --> 04:31.560
Oh, well...

04:32.890 --> 04:34.480
What are you doing here?

04:35.600 --> 04:37.610
I came here to gather some food.

04:38.150 --> 04:39.860
I'm going through a hard time.

04:42.610 --> 04:47.620
I have no intention of harming you
or disrupting your life.

04:49.030 --> 04:49.870
Sir!

05:31.160 --> 05:34.160
Can't you at least serve me
a cup of coffee?

06:02.400 --> 06:03.230
Leave!

06:04.990 --> 06:05.820
Scary!

06:17.410 --> 06:20.210
<i>Jeez! He was such a cranky old man!</i>

06:20.920 --> 06:24.090
He pointed a gun at you
and didn't even apologize for it.

06:25.880 --> 06:27.010
You're so upset, Zero.

06:27.380 --> 06:28.380
<i>Of course!</i>

06:28.630 --> 06:30.220
<i>That was very disrespectful!</i>

06:36.270 --> 06:37.180
Zero, look!

06:39.890 --> 06:42.650
It's the Devil's Fruit! Gross!
It's disgusting!

06:42.730 --> 06:44.520
I like them.

06:44.900 --> 06:46.070
They're sweet and delicious.

06:46.940 --> 06:48.650
I don't care how good it is,

06:48.990 --> 06:51.070
I can't stomach how it looks!

06:52.700 --> 06:54.410
It's not good to be picky.

06:54.830 --> 06:57.750
If you juice it, it'll be a great
replacement to your morning coffee.

06:58.580 --> 07:00.960
You can have all the juice you want, sir.

07:04.540 --> 07:05.420
By the way...

07:05.880 --> 07:08.880
do you think that old man lives there?

07:11.430 --> 07:14.220
Good question. I have no idea.

07:50.420 --> 07:52.300
Sir! I'd like a refill
on my coffee please.

07:52.760 --> 07:53.590
Right away!

08:00.560 --> 08:01.390
Delicious!

08:02.270 --> 08:04.940
Never thought I'd be able
to drink coffee in Magmell.

08:05.360 --> 08:08.360
It's amazing how you were
able to grow coffee on this land.

08:08.730 --> 08:09.650
I'm impressed.

08:10.150 --> 08:12.030
I can't take any credit.

08:13.070 --> 08:14.700
You can thank my daughter for the coffee.

08:43.230 --> 08:44.600
I may have hit the jackpot.

08:45.190 --> 08:48.650
Sir! It's an edible monster!
And get this...

08:49.320 --> 08:52.070
<i>This monster's meat received five stars,</i>

08:52.150 --> 08:54.280
<i>the highest rating</i>
<i>on the Gourmet Monster Reviews!</i>

08:54.860 --> 08:57.620
Well, if that's the case,
I can't let him get away.

08:58.950 --> 09:00.290
We'll savor you so...

09:01.910 --> 09:02.830
please forgive us.

09:11.760 --> 09:13.050
You're pretty fast.

09:14.760 --> 09:15.930
It escaped.

09:16.590 --> 09:19.600
<i>Sir! Please go after him. Hurry, please!</i>

09:20.140 --> 09:20.970
Okay.

09:25.060 --> 09:25.890
Found him.

09:27.940 --> 09:29.480
<i>You're not gonna get away!</i>

09:33.690 --> 09:35.030
Zero, could you go around?

09:36.030 --> 09:37.200
<i>Roger, sir!</i>

10:10.730 --> 10:12.770
I guess it's our lucky day.

10:16.320 --> 10:18.240
<i>Once every ten years?</i>

10:19.070 --> 10:22.370
Yup, it's very rare to encounter one.

10:22.870 --> 10:25.120
It was my first time
to see it in person, too.

10:25.870 --> 10:28.080
<i>It says they're usually underground.</i>

10:28.710 --> 10:29.790
That's right.

10:31.210 --> 10:35.670
When they're hungry, they come out to
the surface. Very economical, I'll say.

10:36.260 --> 10:38.970
Why did they have to come out today?

10:39.510 --> 10:41.050
Our five-star-meat...

10:44.890 --> 10:45.810
<i>Sir?</i>

10:51.350 --> 10:52.230
It's a graveyard.

11:11.000 --> 11:12.670
What are you doing there?

11:30.520 --> 11:32.100
I told you to leave.

12:04.180 --> 12:07.720
I don't care who you are.
You're not allowed to be here!

12:09.600 --> 12:10.430
Leave!

12:42.720 --> 12:46.890
<i>Goodness! He's unbelievable.</i>
<i>What in the world is he thinking?</i>

12:48.510 --> 12:49.890
He missed on purpose.

12:51.180 --> 12:52.310
He's got masterful skills.

12:52.770 --> 12:54.770
<i>Sir! Why are you defending him?</i>

12:55.190 --> 12:58.480
Please listen, it's never okay
to shoot someone, ever!

12:58.980 --> 13:00.570
It's an inhumane act!

13:01.690 --> 13:05.070
What if you're trying to
protect something important?

13:07.620 --> 13:10.790
Something... important...

13:13.500 --> 13:15.920
You'd protect it at any cost.

13:16.750 --> 13:20.590
Especially if it's something you cherish
the most out of everything in life.

13:29.760 --> 13:30.810
Aiza...

14:19.480 --> 14:20.730
It's about time.

14:23.320 --> 14:26.990
Run, run! Hurry!

14:27.070 --> 14:29.200
Hurry, leave everything!

14:29.280 --> 14:30.490
This way!

14:32.830 --> 14:34.240
No!

14:38.870 --> 14:41.630
Hey! What are you doing? Hurry up and run!

14:55.970 --> 14:56.850
Stand up!

15:05.400 --> 15:06.230
Damn it.

15:15.200 --> 15:16.080
Are you okay?

15:16.370 --> 15:17.200
Sir!

15:21.620 --> 15:23.880
Get back. That thing is useless!

15:24.040 --> 15:25.290
Got it. I'll assist.

15:39.480 --> 15:40.440
Sir!

16:12.550 --> 16:14.180
<i>What was that?</i>

16:17.180 --> 16:18.010
Damn it!

16:44.170 --> 16:46.790
<i>Calm down, what are you nervous about?</i>

16:57.510 --> 16:59.680
<i>I knew it, it's that monster again.</i>

17:13.070 --> 17:13.900
Damn it!

17:17.110 --> 17:19.080
<i>Sir, aren't you going to save him?</i>

17:20.700 --> 17:23.160
Do you think that old man
would ever beg for help?

17:24.160 --> 17:25.870
I understand, but...

18:40.110 --> 18:40.950
Aiza...

18:54.000 --> 18:54.920
<i>Sir!</i>

19:29.210 --> 19:30.040
<i>Damn it.</i>

20:42.450 --> 20:43.530
You're there, right?

20:43.990 --> 20:44.950
You caught me.

20:46.780 --> 20:48.990
I was about to swipe some coffee,

20:50.540 --> 20:52.250
but unfortunately,
I missed my opportunity.

21:03.050 --> 21:03.880
Oh, yeah.

21:08.260 --> 21:09.100
Here.

21:12.520 --> 21:14.560
I found this. It's yours, right?

21:16.440 --> 21:18.060
It doesn't suit you at all though.

21:21.570 --> 21:22.400
See you.

21:25.240 --> 21:26.070
Wait.

21:27.780 --> 21:29.280
Come have some coffee.

21:35.660 --> 21:37.210
Never waited so long

21:37.630 --> 21:39.960
for a cup of coffee before.

23:20.890 --> 23:22.690
PREVIEW

23:22.770 --> 23:24.730
<i>Zero, how old are you again?</i>

23:25.020 --> 23:26.030
<i>11 years old.</i>

23:26.440 --> 23:28.150
<i>You must have a lot to worry about.</i>

23:28.400 --> 23:29.780
<i>I have no worries.</i>

23:29.860 --> 23:31.860
<i>And even if I did,</i>
<i>I wouldn't tell you, Big-Breast.</i>

23:32.200 --> 23:35.330
<i>Hey, you know I have a name, right?</i>

23:35.580 --> 23:36.700
<i>It's Emilia--</i>

23:36.790 --> 23:38.870
<i>You have big breasts, you have no choice.</i>

23:39.460 --> 23:41.750
<i>Then, what if they shrunk?</i>

23:42.210 --> 23:43.460
<i>I'd call you Former Big-Breast.</i>

23:43.540 --> 23:45.250
<i>So size doesn't matter at all!</i>

23:46.090 --> 23:49.010
<i>Next time, "The Big Adventure of Zero."</i>
<i>Don't miss it.</i>
